00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:16.180
Fragile U.S. Iran ceasefire faces immediate test as Israel strikes Lebanon,

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:21.300
Iran halts tankers in the strait of Hormuz, and both sides dispute what was actually agreed.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:26.080
A two-week ceasefire between the United States and Iran was announced just before a deadline

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:31.220
set by President Trump. The pause followed weeks of conflict but has quickly come under strain.

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:37.500
Israel has carried out large-scale strikes on Lebanon, killing at least 254 people according

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:44.140
to reports. Iran has halted oil tanker traffic in the strait of Hormuz. Both sides offer conflicting

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:49.860
