00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:55.140
strait. Different perspectives on this are worth noting. The Guardian reports that while world leaders

00:00:55.140 --> 00:01:00.320
expressed relief at the truce, unresolved disputes over its scope threatened to unravel it quickly.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:05.040
Israel and the United States state that Lebanon was not included while Iran insists it was.

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:10.600
The Daily Mail highlights the White House declaring victory even as Tehran demands tolls on the

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:16.620
