Trump's presidency that will haunt him. These perspectives reflect differing priorities.

00:01:54.720 --> 00:02:00.460
Some emphasize immediate humanitarian costs and strategic failure. Others focus on negotiating

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:05.220
