00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:10.200
what exactly was agreed upon in the ceasefire and who has the authority to interpret its terms?

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:13.760
Shifting now to diplomatic efforts around the same crisis,

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:17.680
United Kingdom Foreign Secretary Yvette Cooper is calling for shipping through the

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:23.580
